  "full_text": "I've been getting constant omens or communication from God. Each time I look up, I saw, make passion your business, right? It's on the side of a bus. All the bus signs are messages for me. So this one is like, oh, Terry, so your business is your passion, not Diana. Well, that's not my logic. Basically, I love God, right? God's my passion, right? Love God with all heart, mind, and soul, right? So, like, anyway. So, General Mattis is the voyeur monk. He didn't get married. And, you know, when it comes to a cull, you probably need passion in war to defend your country. When it comes to a cull, you probably need dispassion, right? The monk king. I don't know. It's very dispassionate. Bang, motherfucker. The monk king is dispassionate. What? I don't know. Fuck it. Thank you.",
